      "char_start": 157076,
      "char_end": 157203,
      "text": "CanControllerBaudrateConfig\n1..*\nThis container contains bit timing related configuration\nparameters of the CAN controller(s).\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 23,
      "bbox": [
        77.342,
        410.667,
        499.317,
        428.285
      ],
      "char_start": 157203,
      "char_end": 157337,
      "text": "CanPartialNetwork\n0..1\nContainer gives CAN Controller driver information about the\nconfiguration of Partial Networking functionality.\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 24,
      "bbox": [
        77.342,
        434.242,
        510.746,
        470.789
      ],
      "char_start": 157337,
      "char_end": 157562,
      "text": "CanTTController\n0..1\nCanTTController is specified in the SWS TTCAN and contains\nthe configuration parameters of the TTCAN controller(s) (which\nare needed in addition to the configuration parameters of the\nCAN controller(s)).\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 25,
      "bbox": [
        289.002,
        477.016,
        510.961,
        503.915
      ],
      "char_start": 157562,
      "char_end": 157706,
      "text": "This container is only included and valid if TTCAN is supported\nby the controller, enabled (see CanSupportTTCANRef, ECUC_\nCan_00430), and used.\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 26,
      "bbox": [
        77.342,
        509.777,
        505.709,
        536.859
      ],
      "char_start": 157706,
      "char_end": 157895,
      "text": "CanXLController\n0..1\nThis container is specified in the SWS CAN XL Driver and\nrepresents a CAN XL channel. If this container is present, the\nCAN driver will provide the extended CanXL API.\n"
    },
    {
      "block_no": 27,
      "bbox": [
