      "text": "[SWS_Can_CONSTR_00511] ⌈If CanEcucPartitionRef references one or more ECUC\npartitions, CanControllerEcucPartitionRef shall have a multiplicity of one and reference\none of these ECUC partitions as well.⌋()\n"
